{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1271173-missing-artwork-in-monarchies-of-mau-pdf","id":1271173,"title":"Missing Artwork in Monarchies of Mau PDF?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Realms of Pugmire"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-27T10:07:33-08:00","id":1271173,"title":"Missing Artwork in Monarchies of Mau PDF?","content":"I just downloaded by Kickstarter Backer copy of the MoM PDF. I dunno if this is an Adobe Reader issue or not, but on certain pages, the artwork just shows up as featureless black fields. And I don't think it's an Adobe Reader issue because on other pages, the artwork appears just fine.<br /> <br /> Is anyone else having this issue?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-27T10:17:17-08:00","id":1271176,"title":"","content":"Maybe try on other PDF viewer? I use free one <a href=\"https://www.tracker-software.com/product/pdf-xchange-viewer\" target=\"_blank\">PDF-XChange Viewer</a> as alternative to Adobe. It's often more stable than AR